# max -- the top of the HEADLESS ladder. minimal < normal < max.
#
# Not "every module in the repo": the desktop profiles are a separate track,
# and 30-desktop-plasma / 30-desktop-xfce are alternatives to each other, so
# there is no coherent build with all of them. If you want a GUI you want
# `desktop` or `desktop-xfce`, not this.
#
# Also not "the best one" -- just the biggest headless one. If you are not
# compiling on this machine, `normal` boots faster and updates quicker.
00-core
10-shell
20-dev
